      "description": "Watch MLS All-Stars vs Liga MX All-Stars highlights and goals from Major League Soccer on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on July 30, 2026. The atmosphere was electric at the stadium on 2026-07-30 as Seattle Sounders FC hosted the Liga MX All-Stars in a highly anticipated exhibition match. Fans gathered to witness a clash of styles between two of the region's most prominent footballing forces. Iloski Breaks the Deadlock The match began with high intensity as both sides looked to seize early control. The competitive nature of the tie was signaled in the 12th minute when Hassani Dotson received a yellow card for a robust challenge. The breakthrough finally arrived in the 31st minute when Francis Westfield delivered a pinpoint assist into the path of Milan Iloski . The forward made no mistake, clinical finishing giving Seattle Sounders FC a vital lead before the interval. Tactical Shifts and Final Whistle The second half saw a flurry of substitutions as both managers looked to inject fresh energy into their lineups. Notable entries included Jesus Ferreira , Danny Musovski , and the experienced Alejandro Bedoya , who replaced Cavan Sullivan late in the game. Despite the tactical shifts and sustained pressure from the Liga MX All-Stars , the home defense held firm. The referee blew the final whistle after four minutes of stoppage time, confirming a narrow but impressive victory for the Seattle side."
